broadcasting in their face?

00:02:51.897 --> 00:02:56.422
♪ Through the perilous fight ♪

00:02:56.422 --> 00:02:57.255
- Fight.

00:02:57.255 --> 00:02:58.228
- Flight? Fight?

00:02:58.228 --> 00:02:59.061
- It's fight.

00:02:59.061 --> 00:03:03.221
♪ For the ramparts we watched ♪

00:03:03.221 --> 00:03:08.221
♪ Were so gallantly streaming ♪

00:03:08.370 --> 00:03:12.593
♪ And the rocket's red glare ♪

00:03:12.593 --> 00:03:16.372
♪ The bombs bursting in air ♪

00:03:16.372 --> 00:03:18.823
♪ Gave proof ♪

00:03:18.823 --> 00:03:20.845
♪ Through the night ♪

00:03:20.845 --> 00:03:22.282
♪ That our flag ♪

00:03:22.282 --> 00:03:25.403
♪ Was still there ♪

00:03:25.403 --> 00:03:27.909
♪ Oh, say does that ♪

00:03:27.909 --> 00:03:29.976
♪ Star-Spangled ♪

00:03:29.976 --> 00:03:31.604
♪ Banner ♪

00:03:31.604 --> 00:03:35.320
♪ Yet wave ♪

00:03:35.320 --> 00:03:37.177
♪ O'er the land ♪

00:03:37.177 --> 00:03:40.941
♪ Of the free ♪

00:03:40.941 --> 00:03:43.338
♪ And the home ♪

00:03:43.338 --> 00:03:45.150
♪ Of the ♪

00:03:45.150 --> 00:03:47.734
♪ Brave ♪

00:03:47.734 --> 00:03:49.950
(applause)

00:03:49.950 --> 00:03:51.609
- I definitely messed up the words.

00:03:51.609 --> 00:03:53.872
- You know what, it's harder
than it looks, people.

00:03:53.872 --> 00:03:57.269
- I literally could feel
my nerves and my voice.

00:03:57.269 --> 00:03:59.789
- And so I cannot begin
to imagine what it's like

00:03:59.789 --> 00:04:03.172
for the icons of the world to do this

00:04:03.172 --> 00:04:05.030
